  "contractId": "lp-karriere-original-brand-and-function-parity",
  "purpose": "Prevent silent replacement of approved identity, functions, integration or release target. The user request of 2026-10-28 removes the public career calendar-booking link and its explanatory paragraph on all 22 career pages; all other approved functions remain required.",
