    "acceptedCode": "9b1e2da60ebdafdca9ddcf3a57f6ab90b1f1f858",
    "acceptedEvidence": "../qa/LP_Karriere_ASU_R04_Branding_QA_2026-10-27.md",
    "sourceCaptured": "2026-10-27",
    "referenceRule": "The approved source is authoritative. A candidate must not redefine its own expected values to obtain a passing result."
  },
  "authorizedChanges": [
    "Quality instructions, acceptance contract, verification tooling, CI and evidence retention.",
    "Provider enforcement only within the verified career project and existing user authorization.",
    "Clear the client submission identifier only after an HTTP-success response with ok:true, so the next new application gets a new ID; retain the same ID on retries. No relay, routing, recipient or delivery-contract change. The client file also gains one final LF; no other bytes differ from the approved baseline.",
    "User request on 2026-10-28: «Auf der L&P Karriereseite den Kalenderbuchungslink entfernen. ASU». Remove the career-booking paragraph and link on the overview and all 21 job detail pages, remove only its unused CSS, and update the corresponding contract and test expectations to require its absence. No form, relay, recipient, routing, job-catalog or shared-brand-shell change."
  ],
